<p>I liked it Scanny. Clever use of the <em>multiple</em> 4s, 13s, and 52s, as well as an interesting and clever premise. I'm also not too bothered either way with object class changes&#8230;provided they aren't drastic. If you had come out with a <em>brand new</em> class and given me little justification as to why the S/E/K system wasn't sufficient for the object, then I would've had issues, but this isn't too bad so, not an issue.</p>
<p>That said, I didn't see the bigger hook you hinted at upthread. If you can find a way to bring that out, it would make things more interesting, I think, but as it stands, this is good enough for my +1. Also one of the few coldposts I've seen that actually has a chance of success. Good job on that.</p>

